WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.780
Fight, crash through, and face the challenge!

3
00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.000
These are our hard knock days.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.830
Can't quench our thirst with a peaceful, everyday life.

5
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.340
Here we go - don't ever run away!

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.380
Let's go on living as the mighty winds take us!

7
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.870
We've still got so far to go.

8
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.390
Gotta keep going through the hard knock days.

9
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.610
Let's do it again, yes, baby. How many times

10
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.110
do I have to stand back up to make my dream come true?

11
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.730
Feels like the strength of my resolve

12
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.200
is put to the test everyday.

13
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.700
Hey, let's go!

14
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.450
I don't want to make excuses and settle for being mediocre.

15
00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.960
Hey, let's go!

16
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.670
We leapt into a crazy, lawless world.

17
00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:54.170
As I struggled for a foothold, reality caught me off guard.

18
00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:59.470
Even if it beats me, hits me, knocks me down again,

19
00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.220
Oh!

20
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.560
Only when we get back on our feet and look forward,

21
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.450
will we have the last laugh, be the winners!

22
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.120
We gotta go down this glory road, till we reach our goal!

23
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.720
Fight, shake it off, act strong!

24
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.720
These are our hard knock days.

25
00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.730
There's no such thing as a safe choice.

26
00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.060
Here we go - we'll always be the strongest!

27
00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:27.320
Let's keep moving - never mind the consequences.

28
00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.900
Let's put our wishes all together,

29
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:34.910
and keep on going through the hard knock days.

30
00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:46.130
<b>The Island of Fate: Minion</b>

31
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:55.180
Why?! And since when can you talk?!

32
00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:57.880
Since always.

33
00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:03.300
So you've been... fooling Doflamingo all this time?!

34
00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:09.850
I never claimed that I'd become a mute.
He just assumed so.

35
00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.780
That's the same as fooling him!

36
00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:13.960
What are you thinking?!

37
00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:14.550
Hey now...

38
00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:16.740
Silent!

39
00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.760
Huh? Huh?

40
00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.620
The noise in the streets is gone!

41
00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.770
Why?!

42
00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:38.870
I can see people talking, but I can't hear anything!

43
00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.750
I put up a wall because you were being noisy.

44
00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:42.440
Huh?

45
00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:43.660
A sound-proof wall.

46
00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.040
You can't hear sound from out there, right?

47
00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:50.380
They can't hear us, either.

48
00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:53.420
I ate the Calm Fruit. I'm a soundless man.

49
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.160
A Devil Fruit user?!

50
00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:03.310
What the hell?! Everything about you is a lie!

51
00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:06.760
So does that mean? Your idiotic clumsiness...

52
00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.770
Yeah, of course.

53
00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:12.490
It's all acting.

54
00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.240
Don't lie! Your shoulder's on fire!

55
00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:20.980
I've always been clumsy.
There's nothing for it, I'm just a klutz.

56
00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:24.520
Shut up! The most unbelievable part about you is the only thing that's real?!

57
00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:27.160
Why are you hiding all this from your friends?!

58
00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:29.090
I don't consider them my friends.

59
00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:35.300
What I'm trying to do is stop my big brother Doffy from going out of control.

60
00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:41.200
I don't know how that beast was born from our warm-hearted parents.

61
00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:49.120
He's... inhuman.

62
00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:52.800
Help!

63
00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:58.280
My children have done nothing wrong!

64
00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:00.800
Aim your arrows at me instead!

65
00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:05.340
Please! Don't harm my children!

66
00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:11.240
It hurts, Father! I can't take it anymore!

67
00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:15.930
I'll get even with you bastards!

68
00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.520
Brother...

69
00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.300
I won't die!

70
00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:32.680
I'm gonna survive, no matter what you do to me, and I will...

71
00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:38.940
I will come back and murder every single one of you jerks!

72
00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:43.280
He's evil by nature, and he doesn't fear anything.

73
00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.980
The only people who know how brutal Doffy truly is...

74
00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:52.040
are the four commanders, including myself,

75
00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:55.260
and Vergo, the previous Corazón.

76
00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.310
Vergo?

77
00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:02.690
A strong member of the Family, who's currently working alone on a secret mission of some sort.

78
00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:06.420
The details of the mission were kept secret from even the Family.

79
00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.750
He has nothing to do with you.

80
00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:12.540
Don't become a beast like my brother!

81
00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.360
Get outta here, Law!

82
00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:18.240
No way! I want to be like that!

83
00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:20.760
The secret name "D"... It's no mistake.

84
00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:24.240
You're a part of that fated family — the Family of D.

85
00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:28.390
Back in my homeland, children are disciplined with stories...

86
00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:32.660
"A misbehaving child will be eaten up by D."

87
00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:38.920
People with the name "D" often end up becoming infamous.

88
00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:43.100
Old people will frown and mutter...

89
00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:48.070
"D is sure to cause another storm."

90
00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:52.590
What are you saying?! Am I some kind of monster?

91
00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:53.680
Maybe.

92
00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:56.360
Nobody knows the real reason behind it,

93
00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:01.740
but that name has been ceaselessly and secretly inherited throughout history all across the world.

94
00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:07.280
And in a certain land, there are people who call the Family of "D"...

95
00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.650
"The sworn enemy of the gods"!

96
00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:17.660
Gods?!

97
00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.110
Assuming that "gods" refers to the Celestial Dragons,

98
00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:25.300
your family's goal might be the destruction of this world.

99
00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:32.440
But it's an entirely different kind of destruction from what Doffy wants.

100
00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:36.140
Ds must have an ideal opposed to that of the gods.

101
00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:40.390
I don't know what you're talking about!

102
00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:44.780
I joined the Family to kill every single person as violently as possible!

103
00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:48.620
I'm not your subordinate!
I'm Doflamingo's subordinate!

104
00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:52.420
I'm gonna die in a year!
What am I to do if I get out of here?!

105
00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.570
Get out of here and look for a cure!

106
00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:55.560
There is none!

107
00:06:56.440 --> 00:07:00.980
I'm gonna tell Doflamingo that you can talk,
and about your ability and everything!

108
00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:01.940
Don't do it!

109
00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:05.130
You've got much worse than banishment coming!

110
00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.100
Damn brat!

111
00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:14.170
I've become stronger in the last two years!

112
00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:15.460
Serves you right!

113
00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:21.790
Hey, Law! You broke the blood law again!

114
00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:25.460
Hey, I saw your mouths moving... What were you doing?

115
00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.780
I'll buy you an ice cream, so keep quiet.

116
00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.970
I want the king size that costs 500 belly-dasuyan!

117
00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.740
Baby 5, lend me some money.

118
00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:33.740
What?!

119
00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:35.720
O-Okay!

120
00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:39.320
Blush! He needs me!

121
00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:45.440
Is this it?!

122
00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.000
Dammit!

123
00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:59.380
I trusted that little brat and told him everything!

124
00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:02.290
Corazón!

125
00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:05.880
We gotta set sail! It's Tsuru from Navy HQ again!

126
00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.860
The Navy has found us!

127
00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:11.380
He... hasn't told him yet?

128
00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.860
I decided not to tell him.

129
00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:17.300
I realized...

130
00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.960
I owe you for keeping quiet about me stabbing you two years ago.

131
00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.080
We're even now.

132
00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.850
Sail: Tsuru

133
00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.030
Where are Corazón and Law?

134
00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.960
I saw them on board. Aren't they here?

135
00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.940
Young master! I found this in Corazón's hammock.

136
00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.560
<b>cure Law's disease</b>
<b>I've left to</b>

137
00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:56.770
They packed their things and left, it seems.

138
00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:58.880
What is he thinking?!

139
00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.080
This is kidnapping!

140
00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:09.820
Hey, pick up the Snail Phone!

141
00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.940
Isn't it Doflamingo?! I'll talk!

142
00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:13.510
Pick it up!

143
00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:15.630
I said pick it up! Pick it up!

144
00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.840
Doflamingo! Help!

145
00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:20.240
What are you gonna do to me?!

146
00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:21.460
Hey!

147
00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:29.030
Are you calling Doflamingo?!

148
00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:31.400
Hey! Help me!

149
00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:36.960
"Rice-cracker pellets".
It's me.

150
00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.220
Oh, Rosinante?

151
00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.890
I'm taking leave from my mission for a while.

152
00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:48.420
Sign: Navy

153
00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:55.170
REIGNING JUSTICE

154
00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:52.520
Are you in trouble?

155
00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:53.970
No, it's personal.

156
00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:55.180
Okay, got it.

157
00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.810
How are the kids?

158
00:09:57.810 --> 00:10:00.180
Are they still there despite you giving them a hard time?

159
00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:02.150
I don't think those three will leave...

160
00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:07.820
The Family's become quite infamous now. Be careful.

161
00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:08.520
Yes, Sir.

162
00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:11.540
<b>Navy HQ
Admiral Sengoku</b>

163
00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:15.240
I entrust this case to you, so do as you wish.

164
00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.770
Keep me updated.

165
00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:20.940
Roger that. I'll send you the details in writing.

166
00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:31.690
<b>Commander
Donquixote Rosinante</b>

167
00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:33.720
Admiral Sengoku!

168
00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:38.000
<b>Buddha</b>

169
00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:37.140
The man requesting transfer, who I mentioned the other day, is here.

170
00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:39.180
Alright. Come in.

171
00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:43.660
So it's you.

172
00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.390
I've been hearing about you.

173
00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:50.500
I hear you've done a lot of important work in the past year since you officially joined.

174
00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.410
So you want to transfer to G-5, huh?

175
00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:57.700
First of all, I want to ask you about the sunny-side up egg on your left cheek...

176
00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:59.940
Yes, Sir! My name is Vergo, Sir!

177
00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:04.810
Where were you calling just now?!

178
00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:09.460
You said "mission"! Are you a marine or something?!

179
00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:11.020
You don't like marines?

180
00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.560
People tied to the Government make me sick!

181
00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.320
I'm not a marine.

182
00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.280
Really?!

183
00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:19.620
Hey! I don't wanna go to the hospital!

184
00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.260
Stop acting like some normal kid!

185
00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:24.940
I'm gonna cure your disease!

186
00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.400
I'm gonna take you to every single hospital!

187
00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:31.400
Look! It's a big hospital! I'm sure they can cure you!

188
00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:34.640
Wh... White Lead Disease?!

189
00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:38.210
It's been around for a while now.
Don't you have a good medicine for it, Doc?

190
00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:41.800
E-E-Excuse me, but where are you from?

191
00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:43.580
Flevance.

192
00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.300
The White Town!

193
00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:48.240
No! I'm gonna get infected!

194
00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:51.650
H-Hey! Bring me antiseptic and gloves and a gas mask now!

195
00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:55.090
And call security and the Government! Hurry up!

196
00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:57.480
N-no! Nooo!

197
00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.520
Forget it!

198
00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:58.980
No! No! No! No!

199
00:11:58.240 --> 00:11:59.080
Law!

200
00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.620
Nooo!

201
00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.960
See?! I'm not even a human anymore!

202
00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.690
White monster! Please leave! I beg you!

203
00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:17.380
Hey, you! How dare you bring a kid like that here?!

204
00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:20.080
Do you realize how many patients we have?!

205
00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:22.130
This is an emergency announcement.

206
00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:25.370
We have a child with White Lead Disease in the hospital.

207
00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:32.460
That big guy's violent!

208
00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.500
We are now sterilizing the entire building.

209
00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.080
That was the worst hospital ever!

210
00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.110
My bad. That must have brought back painful memories.

211
00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:45.640
I told you so! I don't wanna go to a hospital!

212
00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.010
That one was terrible...

213
00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.790
But I'm sure there'll be a good doctor in the next one!

214
00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.140
I don't wanna go!

215
00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:58.330
White Lead Disease! No! Somebody, help!

216
00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:00.460
It's a survivor from the White Town!

217
00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:04.450
Let's go to the next! You'll get cured in the next one!

218
00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.400
Enough! I don't wanna go!

219
00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.150
Hello?! World Government?!

220
00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:09.830
We have a survivor from Flevance here!

221
00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.500
Why didn't you kill all of them?!

222
00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:14.880
Look, Law! People in this town look kind!

223
00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:15.840
No!

224
00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:18.960
Ugh! I'm gonna get infected! Go away!

225
00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.080
How dare you call yourself a doctor?!

226
00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.440
Eight hospitals were damaged.

227
00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.740
Which way did those two go?!

228
00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.630
The boy with the disease is...

229
00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:30.390
Corazón, I'm not getting better at all...
You're just making it worse for me!

230
00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:33.220
Stop whining! You'll get cured in the next one!

231
00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:36.870
It's either find the cure or death! Your life is on the line now!

232
00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.060
Stay strong!

233
00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.840
White Lead Disease!

234
00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.030
Close the hospital! They're gonna come in!

235
00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:45.060
I'm gonna kill all y'all!

236
00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.470
No, Corazón!

237
00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.860
Corazón!

238
00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:59.350
<b>Six months later</b>

239
00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:08.790
What am I doing?

240
00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:13.850
I've been making the kid from that tragic town relive the tragedy over and over...

241
00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.820
And he hasn't gotten any better...

242
00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.660
Am I doing it for "D"?

243
00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:23.610
No... I don't care about that anymore.

244
00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:28.510
I just... I just feel real bad for him...

245
00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.450
I'm sure you don't want...

246
00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:34.840
this idiot who just keeps hurting you...

247
00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.610
to say something like this but...

248
00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:43.280
You're still a rude little boy...

249
00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.730
and hearing you say "I'll die soon" is...

250
00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:48.270
heartbreaking.

251
00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:53.440
You... stabbed me... that day, but...

252
00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.560
it didn't hurt at all!

253
00:14:57.780 --> 00:15:00.640
I know you were the one who was in pain!

254
00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.810
You poor thing!

255
00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:04.950
Law!

256
00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.480
Cora-san...

257
00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.170
Hey, Cora-san!

258
00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.220
What's wrong with your face?!

259
00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:36.560
You just called me Cora-san...

260
00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.800
Shut up! Just pick up the Snail Phone!

261
00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:44.190
It's me, Corazón.

262
00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:52.360
Corazón, you're there, aren't you?

263
00:15:57.030 --> 00:16:00.760
It's been six months since you two left.

264
00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.670
Is Law with you?

265
00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.740
Doflamingo!

266
00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:18.430
I see. I'm glad both of you are fine.

267
00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.500
Have you found a good doctor?

268
00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:24.340
I thought not.

269
00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:28.100
Bring Law back to the ship.

270
00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.570
We might be able to cure the disease.

271
00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:37.800
I received information about the Operation Fruit.

272
00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:42.580
The Navy offered a huge sum of cash in a trade with some pirates...

273
00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:47.950
who are too stupid to know its real value, it seems.

274
00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:52.100
The Government must be pulling strings behind the scenes.

275
00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.360
It's risky, but we'll seize it.

276
00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:01.250
Due to the nature of its power, once we have it...

277
00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:05.670
the person I trust the most should eat it.

278
00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.680
You eat it, Corazón.

279
00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:15.250
And cure Law's disease.

280
00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:24.690
What do you guys think?

281
00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:28.090
Even including Tsuru who often smelled us out,

282
00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:32.730
found us, and came after us,

283
00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:38.030
the Navy hasn't showed their face at all in the past six months.

284
00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:41.870
The same six months that Corazón has been away.

285
00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:46.710
Are you saying that he was tipping the Navy off before?

286
00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.710
It could be just a coincidence.

287
00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:55.700
I hope so. I don't want to distrust him...

288
00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:58.210
He's my brother, after all.

289
00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:02.030
Good news! Law!

290
00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:07.820
You have a chance to survive! Forget about the doctors!

291
00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:12.440
If we can get the Operation Fruit, we'd be able to cure your White Lead Disease!

292
00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:14.270
What's the Operation Fruit?

293
00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:16.880
It gives you the ability to modify human bodies!

294
00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:20.110
You can perform miraculous operations and cure unknown diseases with it!

295
00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:23.650
What? Sounds like magic.

296
00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:28.020
Yes! But it's not magic! You need medical knowledge!

297
00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:37.300
I know that you're the son of a doctor who was trusted by the people of Flevance!

298
00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:41.730
So, it's perfect for you!

299
00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:44.970
Me?! Doflamingo said you should eat it!

300
00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:51.860
A person will die if he eats two Devil Fruits.

301
00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:57.100
Doffy said that because he doesn't know that I'm a Devil Fruit user.

302
00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:02.720
Neither of us is ever going back to the Family!

303
00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:14.970
I decided that after realizing that this journey would be a long one.

304
00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:20.910
Doffy probably knows that I'm a traitor by now.

305
00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:26.880
But he didn't seem suspicious. He said you should eat it...

306
00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:31.720
There is another reason for Doffy to say he wants me to eat the Operation Fruit!

307
00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:36.920
Doffy...

308
00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:39.120
Because I'm loyal,

309
00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:42.290
you're looking to have eternal life in exchange for my life, aren't you?

310
00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:44.810
I'll be killed if I go back!

311
00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:51.240
Listen, we'll get a jump on Doffy and the others and steal the Operation Fruit!

312
00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:53.860
You eat the Fruit!

313
00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:58.140
Once you're cured, we'll run away somewhere!

314
00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:05.780
Prepare to set sail!
We'll get the Operation Fruit at any cost!

315
00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:12.830
"Rice crackers"!

316
00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:14.320
"Rice-cracker pellets". It's me.

317
00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:18.730
Rosinante! It's been a while. I've been worried about you!

318
00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:20.530
Hey, Garp! Get out for a bit!

319
00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:25.710
What?! I just brought you crackers!
Put some tea on for me!

320
00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:27.400
Vice Admiral Garp...

321
00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:30.110
Should I call you later instead, Sengoku-san?

322
00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:35.380
Get out! Idiot! I gotta work! W-O-R-K!

323
00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:39.280
Oh, Kuzan!
Do you wanna snack on some crackers with me?

324
00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:42.840
Um... Can I talk?

325
00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.920
Yeah, sorry. Go ahead.

326
00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:47.560
Is it true that you've made a deal for the Operation Fruit?

327
00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:53.560
H-How did you know?!

328
00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:55.670
My brother has found out.

329
00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:59.370
What?! But it's top secret!

330
00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:03.270
Cora-san must be talking to...

331
00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:06.580
I wanna know those pirates' activities.

332
00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:10.350
I don't think we can find them before the trade...

333
00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:15.650
Even if Doflamingo is looking to steal the Operation Fruit before the trade?

334
00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:17.150
He is?!

335
00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:18.780
Oh? Hm?

336
00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.520
I feel kind of dizzy...

337
00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:24.700
When and where will the trade be?

338
00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:28.600
Three weeks from now, at Rubeck in North Blue.

339
00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:31.100
Rubeck...

340
00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:38.180
Doffy wants me to meet up with him and the others at
Swallow Island three days before the trade.

341
00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:39.880
Three days before, huh?

342
00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:44.980
So I guess all of the Family members will be there, ready for battle.

343
00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:46.950
That's a good tip.

344
00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:51.950
That'll be it for Doflamingo!
We'll wait for him at Swallow Island

345
00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:55.580
and ambush him, catching the entire Donquixote Family in one fell swoop!

346
00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:58.030
You stay away from the island!

347
00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:00.320
I was planning on it.

348
00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:06.830
The list of all Doffy's business partners and the big shots connected with him behind the scenes...

349
00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:09.270
I'll give it to you sometime soon.

350
00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:14.840
I think it'll be more than enough for you to uncover the dark side of the North Blue.

351
00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:16.750
Okay. Thank you.

352
00:22:19.490 --> 00:22:22.190
Hey, Law. Are you ready?

353
00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:23.320
We gotta sail out...

354
00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:25.420
Law!

355
00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:29.240
Hey! Wait! You gotta be kidding! Stay with me!

356
00:22:30.900 --> 00:22:34.000
Not now! We finally have a chance!

357
00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:36.210
It's not been three years yet!

358
00:22:36.210 --> 00:22:38.540
I thought you still had time left according to your calculation!

359
00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:42.610
Oh no! He has a very high fever! What should I do?!

360
00:22:42.610 --> 00:22:45.110
Doctors are all useless!

361
00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:49.260
Dammit! What am I supposed to do?! Tell me, Law!

362
00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:50.750
Please make it!

363
00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:54.860
Stay alive for another three weeks!

364
00:22:55.750 --> 00:22:57.980
Give me a chance!

365
00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:11.370
<b>Three days before the trade</b>

366
00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:06.980
Dammit! Why does it have to be so choppy now?!

367
00:23:07.380 --> 00:23:08.890
Cora-san...

368
00:23:08.890 --> 00:23:11.370
Huh? What's wrong, Law?!

369
00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:16.070
The Government knew that we would die...

370
00:23:16.070 --> 00:23:19.210
But they kept making us dig up White Lead, for money!

371
00:23:20.470 --> 00:23:23.880
My family... and the people of Flevance...

372
00:23:24.980 --> 00:23:27.250
The Government killed them!

373
00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:36.040
So if you're a marine allied with them,

374
00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:37.830
tell me the truth.

375
00:23:37.830 --> 00:23:41.370
That's absurd! I'm not a marine!

376
00:23:44.100 --> 00:23:45.440
Good!

377
00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:49.110
In fact... You need to realize...

378
00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:51.710
Stealing the Operation Fruit means...

379
00:23:51.710 --> 00:23:56.560
we'll make enemies of everybody...
Doflamingo, the Navy, and the Government!

380
00:23:56.970 --> 00:23:59.260
We'll be chased by all of them!

381
00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:02.600
You better be prepared to fight for survival!

382
00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:15.550
<b>Minion Island</b>

383
00:24:10.180 --> 00:24:13.500
Have you found the pirates, Sengoku-san?

384
00:24:13.500 --> 00:24:17.570
Yeah. East of Rubeck where we're making the deal...

385
00:24:18.570 --> 00:24:21.470
Minion Island's there, with a ghost town.

386
00:24:21.470 --> 00:24:24.110
Looks like that's where their hideout is.

387
00:24:25.210 --> 00:24:29.480
The pirate's name is Diez Barrels. Sound familiar?

388
00:24:29.480 --> 00:24:32.230
Yeah, he's a former Navy officer...

389
00:24:32.230 --> 00:24:33.640
That's right.

390
00:24:34.470 --> 00:24:38.690
Our scout-ship is staking out Minion Island now.

391
00:24:41.780 --> 00:24:47.230
Meanwhile, at Swallow Island where you and Doflamingo were going to meet up,

392
00:24:47.230 --> 00:24:50.570
there are two warships.

393
00:24:51.570 --> 00:24:55.770
I won't let Doflamingo steal the Operation Fruit!

394
00:24:56.570 --> 00:25:00.440
Law, it won't be long. Wait here...

395
00:25:19.940 --> 00:25:22.730
Dray! Booze! Bring more booze!

396
00:25:24.050 --> 00:25:25.440
Right away.

397
00:25:25.440 --> 00:25:29.800
How much do you think this one fruit would cost?

398
00:25:30.370 --> 00:25:32.100
They offered five billion!

399
00:25:34.410 --> 00:25:38.280
How ridiculous! Did the Government go nuts?!

400
00:25:38.280 --> 00:25:43.620
Once we got that much money, there's no reason for us to be pirates!

401
00:25:46.330 --> 00:25:47.420
Right, right!

402
00:25:48.710 --> 00:25:50.780
It may sound too simple but...

403
00:25:51.550 --> 00:25:53.390
once a doctor eats this,

404
00:25:53.390 --> 00:25:57.300
they'll become a famous doctor in great demand all over the world.

405
00:25:59.480 --> 00:26:05.200
There was a legendary doctor who ate this and cured intractable or rare diseases...

406
00:26:05.200 --> 00:26:08.140
by performing miraculous operations, they say.

407
00:26:09.220 --> 00:26:13.190
But it has nothing to do with us!

408
00:26:13.190 --> 00:26:15.050
Yeah, getting money is way better!

409
00:26:15.050 --> 00:26:16.720
That's right!

410
00:26:23.100 --> 00:26:24.530
Look at this, Law!

411
00:26:25.330 --> 00:26:28.870
This trick makes everything I touch completely soundless!

412
00:26:29.470 --> 00:26:30.940
Calm!

413
00:26:35.500 --> 00:26:36.770
Silence!

414
00:26:38.640 --> 00:26:39.440
That face...

415
00:26:44.290 --> 00:26:46.780
Silence!

416
00:26:47.680 --> 00:26:48.450
Stinks!

417
00:26:49.250 --> 00:26:51.820
See? You heard nothing, right?!

418
00:26:51.820 --> 00:26:54.760
What is that ability good for?!

419
00:26:54.760 --> 00:26:56.060
It's not even cool!

420
00:26:57.020 --> 00:26:59.560
Baby 5's Weapon Fruit is much better than that!

421
00:27:00.900 --> 00:27:04.100
D-Damn! You're right! I wish I had that power!

422
00:27:04.100 --> 00:27:07.700
But no one can have a peaceful rest like me...

423
00:27:07.700 --> 00:27:08.960
Whatever!

424
00:27:28.260 --> 00:27:30.190
What was that quake?!

425
00:27:31.330 --> 00:27:36.490
Captain! Th-There wasn't any noise but the compound's exploded!

426
00:27:36.490 --> 00:27:39.440
What?! That can't be happening!

427
00:27:41.090 --> 00:27:43.210
The treasury is on fire!

428
00:27:43.710 --> 00:27:45.780
Put out the fire now!

429
00:27:45.780 --> 00:27:46.980
What's going on?!

430
00:27:50.310 --> 00:27:52.120
Is there an invader?!

431
00:27:53.780 --> 00:27:55.140
The lights went out!

432
00:27:55.140 --> 00:27:56.590
Pieces of glass are falling onto us!

433
00:27:56.590 --> 00:27:59.220
The lamps! The lamps are broken!

434
00:28:00.360 --> 00:28:03.120
Somebody! Somebody put on a light...

435
00:28:04.960 --> 00:28:07.030
Hurry up and put on a light!

436
00:28:22.980 --> 00:28:26.220
Silence!

437
00:28:34.530 --> 00:28:37.230
I got it, Law! It's the Operation Fruit!

438
00:28:39.060 --> 00:28:41.100
Your disease will be cured!

439
00:28:51.940 --> 00:28:53.890
Who's this?! He scared me!

440
00:28:53.890 --> 00:28:55.980
Where did he tumble down from?

441
00:28:55.980 --> 00:29:00.850
Hey! A guy in a dark coat stole the Operation Fruit!

442
00:29:00.850 --> 00:29:02.490
Don't let him get away!

443
00:29:04.220 --> 00:29:05.420
It's him!

444
00:29:20.420 --> 00:29:23.740
I know it's hard but... wait here for a while.

445
00:29:27.800 --> 00:29:29.040
I'll be back in no time.

446
00:29:30.180 --> 00:29:32.080
With the Operation Fruit!
